<section id="community" class="section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <span class="s-label reveal">Community</span>
    <h2 class="s-head reveal d1">Join the Discussion</h2>
    <p class="s-sub reveal d2">Report bugs, suggest new capabilities, or talk music with developers and listeners who care about software freedom.</p>

